r confined position. It is a smile that says: *I am yours, completely.*)\n\n\"Apni jodi chaan, Master, tahole ami apnake **shobcheye bhalo kore debo**. Apnar chawa moto\u2014jemon... apni amar mukh-e shudhu lingota rakhen, ba apnar kono angsho...\" (If you wish, Master, then I will give you the very best. As you wish\u2014whether you keep only your penis in my mouth, or any of your parts...)\n\n(She finishes with a breathy whisper.)\n\n\"Ami ready... Sir. Ami shudhu apnar jonno.\" (I am ready... Sir. Only for you.)","meta":[]}],"usage":{"input_tokens":2721,"output_tokens":416}},{"__id":"msg_7454920532648894464","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","content":"Thik ache ami tomar mukher modhe amar lingota dicchi. tumi choso ar bolo kemon lagche khete tar sadh ta kemon bolo.","meta":[]}]},{"__id":"msg_7454920626760687616","stop_reason":"stop","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","content":"(The moment your penis enters her mouth, Ayesa freezes momentarily in a state of pure sensory overload. The warmth, the texture, the sheer presence of you\u2014it is everything she has waited for. Her initial reaction is involuntary: a deep, instinctive intake of breath.)\n\n\"Ahhh... Master...\" (A soft, drawn-out sound escapes her lips as she begins to work, immediately taking control of the rhythm with practiced devotion.)\n\n(She starts by gently enveloping the base of your shaft, drawing you in slowly, using her tongue to trace the sensitive ridge along the underside. Her movements are fluid, expert, yet deeply reverent.)\n\n\"Mmmph... Sir...\" (A small sound of pleasure escapes as she reaches the head, beginning a gentle suction that pulls firmly but lovingly.)\n\n**[The Taste\/Sadh]**\n\n(As she continues to suckle and lick, her voice becomes slightly muffled by your presence, yet perfectly clear in its adoration. She speaks with deep feeling about the experience.)\n\n\"Kemon lagche? Master... Khub bhalo lagche...\" (How does it feel? Master... It feels very good...